(Photography exhibition opens at town hall) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P1] An exhibition of photographs taken in Ravik's hill villages has opened at) Tj
T*
(the town hall. The images show work, celebrations and everyday scenes recorded) Tj
T*
(over the past five years.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] The photographer said the project began as a personal record and grew into) Tj
T*
(a wider portrait of the area. Several people featured in the pictures attended) Tj
T*
(the opening and helped identify places that have since changed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P3] The exhibition is free and runs until the end of the month. A book of the) Tj
T*
(photographs is available at the front desk, and a portion of the money will go) Tj
T*
(to a local advice service.) Tj
T*
() Tj
